      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高频增强（LavaSR）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High-band enhancement (LavaSR)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起始频率": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts at"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 AI 修复之后重新生成起始频率以上的高频，让声音更通透；低于起始频率的部分保持不变。“自动”按录音实际带宽决定。首次使用会下载约 56 MB 的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After AI restoration, regenerates the band above the start frequency for a more open sound; everything below it is kept. “Auto” follows the recording’s actual bandwidth. The first use downloads a 56 MB model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动波形两端的黄色手柄裁掉开头和结尾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the yellow handles at either end of the waveform to trim the start and end"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动去首尾静音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trim Silence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把开头和结尾的静音裁掉，两端各留 0.25 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes silence at the start and end, keeping 0.25 s on each side"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还原": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消裁剪，保留整段录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove the trim and keep the whole recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "裁剪起点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trim start"
          }
        }
      }
