    "强降噪（Inworld）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strong noise removal (Inworld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 AI 修复之前先把人声从强背景噪声（音乐、人声嘈杂、风扇）里分离出来；安静环境下不需要。首次使用会下载约 256 MB 的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separates the voice from heavy background noise (music, crowds, fans) before AI restoration; not needed in a quiet room. Downloads a 256 MB model on first use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "始终开启": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按顺序运行下面开启的模型。点开每一项可以看说明和参数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs the models switched on below, in order. Open an item for its description and settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 修复（RE-USE）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI restoration (RE-USE)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "处理后端": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Processing Backend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RE-USE 后端": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RE-USE backend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ANE 混合（神经引擎 + GPU）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ANE hybrid (Neural Engine + GPU)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未安装 Core ML 包，只能用 MLX GPU。开发版用 tools/coreml/export_reuse_coreml.py 导出安装。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Core ML packages are not installed, so only MLX GPU is available. Development builds install them with tools/coreml/export_reuse_coreml.py."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没测速；“自动”暂时使用 MLX GPU。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not measured yet; Automatic uses MLX GPU for now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "测速（约 1.5 分钟）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measure Speed (about 1.5 min)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音棚音色": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Studio Tone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "强度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amount"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "测量这段人声的长期频谱，按八度频段自动 EQ，向近距离录音棚话筒录的人声靠拢（参考 VCTK 录音棚语料，按音高自动选男声或女声曲线）。每段最多 ±6 dB，只改音色，不改内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measures the long-term spectrum of this voice and EQs it, octave by octave, towards speech recorded close to a studio microphone (VCTK studio corpus; the male or female curve is picked from the pitch). At most ±6 dB per band; it changes tone only, never the content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止并保存（⌘R）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop and Save (⌘R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始录音（⌘R）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
