    "丢弃": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止后会先保存，再请你命名。快捷键：⌘R 开始 / 停止，⌘⌫ 丢弃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stopping saves first, then asks for a name. Shortcuts: ⌘R start / stop, ⌘⌫ discard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止后直接用默认名称保存（可在设置里改）。快捷键：⌘R 开始 / 停止，⌘⌫ 丢弃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stopping saves under the default name (change this in Settings). Shortcuts: ⌘R start / stop, ⌘⌫ discard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "丢弃这段录音？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discard this recording?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录到的内容会被删除，不会保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What was recorded is deleted and not saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后不再询问，直接用默认名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don’t ask again; keep the default name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止录音后询问名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask for a name after stopping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后直接用“月日 时.分 录音”作为名称，之后可双击标题或在“更多操作”菜单里改名。快捷键：⌘R 开始 / 停止并保存，⌘⌫ 丢弃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, recordings keep their default date-and-time name; rename later by double-clicking the title or from the More menu. Shortcuts: ⌘R start / stop and save, ⌘⌫ discard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 修复加母带处理，导出的就是它": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI restoration plus mastering: this is what gets exported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三路按响度对齐，比较的是音质而不是音量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All three are loudness-matched, so you compare quality, not volume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
