    "先完成 AI 修复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run AI restoration first"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把人声从强背景声（音乐、人群、风扇）里分离出来，再做 AI 修复。安静的房间不需要。首次使用下载约 256 MB 的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separates the voice from loud backgrounds (music, crowds, fans) before AI restoration. Not needed in a quiet room. Downloads a 256 MB model on first use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部处理并导出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Process and Export All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除所选…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Selected…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原声。AI 处理后可以对比“AI 处理后”和“成品”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original. Process it to compare with Processed and Final."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去噪、去混响、修复音色。录音里有笑声时选“保留笑声”，避免笑声被当成噪声去掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes noise and reverb and repairs the tone. Choose Keep laughter if the recording has laughter, so it isn't removed as noise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去掉噪声和房间回声，修复麦克风音色。开启的模型会按下面的顺序运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes noise and room echo and repairs the microphone's tone. The models switched on run in the order below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双击重命名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-click to rename"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只保留这一段；拖动波形两端的手柄调整": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only this span is kept; drag the handles at either end of the waveform to adjust it"
