    "只有 AI 修复，还没做母带": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI restoration only, before mastering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在控制中心把麦克风模式设为“标准”，避免 macOS 预先处理声音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Mic Mode to Standard in Control Center so macOS doesn't pre-process the sound."
          }
        }
      }
